    // AboutIntro paragraphs
    "Core Migration is a premier international recruitment and manpower solutions company connecting leading global employers with exceptional talent from South Asia. With a strong operational network across 30+ countries, we have successfully placed over 50,000 professionals in roles that transform businesses and change lives.": "Core Migration je vodeća kompanija za međunarodno regrutovanje i rešenja za radnu snagu, koja povezuje vodeće globalne poslodavce sa izuzetnim talentima iz Južne Azije. Sa jakom operativnom mrežom u preko 30 zemalja, uspešno smo zaposlili preko 50.000 stručnjaka u ulogama koje transformišu poslovanje i menjaju živote.",
    "From healthcare and engineering to hospitality, construction, and IT, our specialist recruiters understand the unique demands of every industry we serve. We do more than fill vacancies — we build long-term workforce partnerships that drive growth, performance, and success for both employers and candidates. Our end-to-end recruitment solutions — including sourcing, vetting, trade testing, visa processing, and pre-departure preparation — set a benchmark for excellence in global manpower deployment.": "Od zdravstva i inženjeringa do ugostiteljstva, građevinarstva i IT-ja, naši stručnjaci razumeju jedinstvene zahteve svake industrije. Radimo više od popunjavanja radnih mesta — gradimo dugoročna partnerstva koja pokreću rast, performanse i uspeh poslodavaca i kandidata. Naša rešenja obuhvataju sve faze zapošljavanja.",

