    // AboutIntro paragraphs
    "Core Migration is a premier international recruitment and manpower solutions company connecting leading global employers with exceptional talent from South Asia. With a strong operational network across 30+ countries, we have successfully placed over 50,000 professionals in roles that transform businesses and change lives.": "Core Migration je vodeća međunarodna kompanija za zapošljavanje i rješenja u oblasti radne snage, koja povezuje vodeće globalne poslodavce sa izuzetnim kadrovima iz Južne Azije. Sa snažnom operativnom mrežom u više od 30 zemalja, uspješno smo zaposlili preko 50.000 stručnjaka na pozicijama koje mijenjaju poslovanje i živote.",
    "From healthcare and engineering to hospitality, construction, and IT, our specialist recruiters understand the unique demands of every industry we serve. We do more than fill vacancies — we build long-term workforce partnerships that drive growth, performance, and success for both employers and candidates. Our end-to-end recruitment solutions — including sourcing, vetting, trade testing, visa processing, and pre-departure preparation — set a benchmark for excellence in global manpower deployment.": "Od zdravstva i inženjerstva do ugostiteljstva, građevinarstva i IT sektora, naši specijalizovani konsultanti razumiju jedinstvene potrebe svake industrije kojoj služimo. Radimo više od popunjavanja radnih mjesta — gradimo dugoročna partnerstva u oblasti radne snage koja podstiču rast i uspjeh.",

