    // AboutIntro paragraphs
    "Core Migration is a premier international recruitment and manpower solutions company connecting leading global employers with exceptional talent from South Asia. With a strong operational network across 30+ countries, we have successfully placed over 50,000 professionals in roles that transform businesses and change lives.": "Core Migration je vodilno mednarodno podjetje za zaposlovanje in kadrovske rešitve, ki vodilne globalne delodajalce povezuje z izjemnimi kadri iz Južne Azije. Z močno operativno mrežo v več kot 30 državah smo uspešno zaposlili več kot 50.000 strokovnjakov na delovnih mestih, ki preoblikujejo podjetja in spreminjajo življenja.",
    "From healthcare and engineering to hospitality, construction, and IT, our specialist recruiters understand the unique demands of every industry we serve. We do more than fill vacancies — we build long-term workforce partnerships that drive growth, performance, and success for both employers and candidates. Our end-to-end recruitment solutions — including sourcing, vetting, trade testing, visa processing, and pre-departure preparation — set a benchmark for excellence in global manpower deployment.": "Od zdravstva in inženiringa do gostinstva, gradbeništva in IT-ja naši specializirani kadrovski svetovalci razumejo edinstvene potrebe vsake panoge, ki jo pokrivamo. Naredimo več kot le zapolnimo prosta delovna mesta — gradimo dolgoročna kadrovska partnerstva, ki spodbujajo rast in uspeh.",

