    "Connecting South Asia's talent-sourcing regions with high-demand destination markets across the Gulf, the UK, and Europe.": "Povezujemo regije iskanja talentov v Južni Aziji s ciljnimi trgi visokega povpraševanja v Zalivu, Veliki Britaniji in Evropi.",
